{"data":{"body":"[P2] Continue owner-thread cleanup after the first fatal. `runOperationHook` stops immediately, so a faulty earlier plugin prevents later plugins such as OTel from closing attempt scopes on their owning worker, potentially leaking trace/MDC state into worker reuse. Dispatch every plugin's `onUserFunctionEnd`, preserve the first fatal, then notify and rethrow it. Add a regression asserting later cleanup runs.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76jsYO","finding_digest":"1e1b66f86559f0d203e9ff310f12cf85bd017181f299a88fb3a089a23b5d5df2","finding_id":"arf_v1_dynwn6dflhynea7j74yq6ewpqw","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/plugin-runner::on-user-function-end::fatal-aborts-owner-cleanup","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/plugin-runner::on-user-function-end::fatal-aborts-owner-cleanup","line":403,"observation_digest":"dd0c7e876818c3377bab8a4d3b0fb32c6766869f30cd36b29c0980e06f1747e8","observation_id":"aro_v1_3ugh5b3iddbto65lrjgtwd5tfr","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_dynwn6dflhynea7j74yq6ewpqw","published_at":"2026-10-07T06:10:07Z","review_id":"arr_v1_b6uppoo2uxcseal3hiinbtxkio","reviewed_base_sha":"f4e4e1db81c6fb0fbbaf25815d73757abf3fda7c","reviewed_head_sha":"78373abd264dea4c4c5ee5b2cc7c8982639c71af","reviewer":"codex","start_line":403,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_qvzwssuf7rqwuy6xq2uenfrsm7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T06:10:07Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
